{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HLs3QLhWHrA7SDa4ZBykAg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 symb_invariant_consensus 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (85 个)\\n\\n- **sica_k_sensitivity_14b**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-011-llama8b**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp-016-weighted-sc**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-005**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **sica_folio30**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_d016_c0_precheck**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sica_proofwriter30_v2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_proofwriter30**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_v2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_t07**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_math50_t07**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_smoke_5q**: DONE (success) — \\n- **smoke-test-5q**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **crd_folio_main**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n<!-- AUTO-FACTS-BEGIN (generated 2026-05-19T04:20:46Z; do not edit — regenerated by auto_build_report_facts) -->\\n## 📊 当前状态（auto-derived from registry）\\n\\n**总计**: 85 个实验 — DEPLOYED 1, DONE 76, PREPARING 1, QUEUED 2, RUNNING 5\\n**DONE 分布**: failed 18, killed 9, negative 29, success 20\\n\\n### GPU 占用\\n- **实际运行**: 1 张 — westd-16639:cuda:3(exp-048-llama8b-pw600)\\n\\n### 💾 磁盘余量\\n- **westd-25068**:\\n  - `/init`: 150M/150M 可用（已用 0%）\\n  - `/autodl-pub`: 5.3T/7.3T 可用（已用 24%）\\n  - `/usr/bin/nvidia-smi`: 435G/879G 可用（已用 48%）\\n- **westd-16639**:\\n  - `/autodl-pub`: 5.3T/7.3T 可用（已用 24%）\\n  - `/init`: 150M/150M 可用（已用 1%）\\n  - `/usr/bin/nvidia-smi`: 502G/879G 可用（已用 40%）\\n\\n### 🏃 RUNNING\\n| exp_id | server | gpu | pid | log |\\n|--------|--------|-----|-----|-----|\\n| `exp-039-14b-pw600-16639` | westd-16639 | ? | ? | `—` |\\n| `exp-040-qwen3-pw600-16639` | westd-16639 | ? | ? | `—` |\\n| `exp-048-llama8b-pw600` | westd-16639 | cuda:3 | ? | `—` |\\n| `exp-051-mistral-k-sensitivity` | westd-25068 | ? | ? | `—` |\\n| `exp-058-mistral-folio204-t05` | westd-25068 | ? | ? | `—` |\\n\\n### 📌 最近完成 (top 5)\\n- `exp-057-mist