{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XHEuaEvAu99w6m9n5BTNEf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# symb_invariant_consensus — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 04:32 UTC | 更新原因: κ 统一完成 + exp-055/057 DONE + Dual Bottleneck framing + GPU 利用率存疑\\\\n\\\\n> D060: 纯 Analysis paper — Dual Bottleneck (Independence + Quality)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**纯 Analysis Paper — Dual Bottleneck Framework**。SICA 效应 real but fragile (2/3 seeds significant: p=0.013, p=0.039)。Condorcet Eff-K + oracle gap + 9 种修复全失败 + K/T sensitivity inverted-U。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Paper Writing (Step 3 Draft) + 最后 ablation 实验\\\\n- **论文**: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（~6 天）\\\\n- **κ 统一**: 完成。13 条件统一脚本 (compute_fleiss_kappa_unified.py)，Mistral 三 seed κ=0.457-0.460 收敛\\\\n- **Dual Bottleneck**: Independence (Eff-K) + Quality (SC) 双必要条件，exp-055 直接验证（Eff-K↑ but delta=0）\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260519T034058 (full review mode) 进行中，writing 阶段\\\\n- **Paper Agent**: Step 3 Draft（method ✅，experiments 进行中），κ 修正 patch 队列中\\\\n- **⚠️ GPU 利用率存疑**: auto-facts 仅确认 1/8 GPU 在跑，已发紧急核实指令\\\\n\\\\n## K Sensitivity (inverted U, 论文核心 ablation)\\\\n| K | SC% | SICA% | Δpp | p-value | Status |\\\\n|---|-----|-------|-----|---------|--------|\\\\n| 4 | 54.41 | 52.94 | -1.47 | 0.629 | ✅ |\\\\n| 8 | 57.35 | 56.37 | -0.98 | 0.754 | ✅ |\\\\n| 12 | 54.41 | 59.31 | **+4.90** | **0.013** | ✅ |\\\\n| 16 | 55.88 | 57.35 | +1.47 | 0.629 | ✅ |\\\\n| 20 | — | — | — | — | exp-051 RUNNING (待核实) |\\\\n\\\\n## T Sensitivity (inverted U, 3/4 confirmed)\\\\n| T | Δpp | p-value | κ(unified) | Eff-K | Status |\\\\n|---|-----|---------|------------|-------|--------|\\\\n| 0.3 | -0.49 | 1.0 | 0.502 | 1.84 | ✅ exp-057 (registry=failed, 数据已保存) |\\\\n| 0.5 | — | — | — | — | exp-058 RUNNING (待核实) |\\\\n| 0.7 | +4.90 | 0.013 | 0.460 | 1.98 | ✅ exp-033 |\\\\n| 1.0 | +0.49 | 0.739 | 0.394 | 2.25 | ✅ exp-054 |\\\\nT↑ → κ↓ → Eff-K↑（更独立），但 delta 倒 U 型 → T=0.7 是 independence-quality 平衡点\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中实验 (待 Agent GPU 核实)\\\\n| Server | GPU | Experiment | 预期状态 |\\\\n|--------|-----|------------|----------|\\\\n| westd-25068 | cuda:0 | exp-051 K=20 | RUNNING? |\\\\n| westd-25068 | cuda:1 | exp-034 Qwen-14B PW-600 | 状态不明 |\\\\n| westd-25068 | cuda:2 | — | 空闲 (exp-057 完) |\\\\n| westd-25068 | cuda:3 | exp-058 Mistral T=0.5 | RUNNING? |\\\\n| westd-16639 | cuda:0 | exp-039 Qwen-14B PW-600 | RUNNING? |\\\\n| westd-16639 | cuda:1 | exp-040 Qwen3 PW-600 | RUNNING? |\\\\n| westd-16639 | cuda:2 | — | 空闲 (exp-028b killed 166/204) |\\\\n| westd-16639 | cuda:3 | exp-048 LLaMA-8B PW-600 | 确认在跑 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] GPU 核实（紧急，已发 Agent）\\\\n- [ ] exp-058 T=0.5 完成 → T sensitivity 4 点曲线\\\\n- [ ] exp-051 K=20 完成 → K sensitivity 5 点曲线\\\\n- [ ] exp-028b resume (38/204 remaining，thinking mode κ=0.913)\\\\n- [ ] Table 1 SC inconsistency (exp-026 75.00% vs exp-031 75.49%)\\\\n- [ ] Dream 结果处理\\\\n- [ ] PW-600 系列完成（exp-034 vs exp-039 对比）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent Step 3 完成 → Step 4/5\\\\n- [ ] Submit to Review team\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-25068: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell — 2-3/4 在用（待核实）\\\\n- westd-16639: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell — 2-3/4 在用（待核实）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D061 | 2026-05-19 | D061: Table 1 SC tie-breaking 统一为字母序 (75.49%)，Tabl | exp-026-folio204-trace-regen, exp-031-oracle-folio-regen, exp-033-mistral-folio204, exp-046-mistral-pw600 |\\\\n| D060 | 2026-05-19 | D060: Method improvement 三路失败 — 放弃 method contribu | exp-054-mistral-folio204-t10, exp-055-multitemp-mistral-folio, exp-052-mistral-folio204-seed123, exp-033-mistral-folio204 |\\\\n| D059 | 2026-05-19 | D059: Scenario 2 确认 — 投 May 25 不变，≥3.0 兜底，启动论文升级策略 | exp-052-mistral-folio204-seed123, exp-053-mistral-folio204-seed456, exp-033-mistral-folio204 |\\\\n| D058 | 2026-05-18 | D058: exp-050b/049b interim 挑战 Goldilocks Zone SC- | exp-050b-mistral-icl-oracle, exp-049-mistral-logiqa200, exp-028b-qwen3-thinking, exp-033-mistral-folio204 |\\\\n| D057 | 2026-05-18 | D057: Bidirectional regime boundary — exp-046 reve | exp-046-mistral-pw600, exp-033, exp-044b-icl-oracle |\\\\n| D056 | 2026-05-18 | D056: Entropy-conditioned analysis integrated as c | exp-033, exp-026-folio204-trace-regen |\\\\n| D055 | 2026-05-18 | D055: Final framing confirmed — regime-dependent c | exp-033, exp-044-icl-oracle, exp-020-llama8b-folio-204, exp-031-oracle-folio-regen |\\\\n| D054 | 2026-05-18 | Approve cuda:1 for exp-028 Qwen3-14B thinking mode | exp-028 |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-18 | ICL Oracle partial result (n=148) strengthens regi | exp-044, exp-033 |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-18 | Paper framing升级：从\\\\\\\"universal capability trap\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"reg | exp-033, exp-001, exp-031, exp-034 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4290, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FDv5Qup6yKSNeEim8mDt7d","session_id":"6507131f-6f8a-40f6-a3e2-658e4faa24e8","uuid":"4617d8e5-bcbc-44e1-b2c0-923b8b63f42e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T04:35:48.772Z"}
